{"files":[{"content":"#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <cstdint>\n#include <algorithm>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst int MOD = 1000000007;\n\nint main() {\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n\n    int n, m;\n    if (!(cin >> n >> m)) return 0;\n    vector<vector<int> > obstacles(n);\n    for (int c = 0; c < m; ++c) {\n        int y, x;\n        cin >> y >> x;\n        obstacles[y].push_back(x);\n    }\n\n    vector<int> dp(n, 0);\n    vector<uint64_t> blocked((n + 63) / 64, 0);\n    dp[0] = 1;\n\n    for (int y = 0; y < n; ++y) {\n        fill(blocked.begin(), blocked.end(), uint64_t(0));\n        for (int x : obstacles[y])\n            blocked[x >> 6] |= uint64_t(1) << (x & 63);\n\n        int left = 0;\n        for (int base = 0; base < n; base += 64) {\n            const int end = min(n, base + 64);\n            uint64_t bits = blocked[base >> 6];\n            int x = base;\n            while (bits != 0) {\n                const int stop = base + __builtin_ctzll(bits);\n                for (; x < stop; ++x) {\n                    int sum = dp[x] + left;\n                    if (sum >= MOD) sum -= MOD;\n                    dp[x] = left = sum;\n                }\n                dp[x++] = 0;\n                left = 0;\n                bits &= bits - 1;\n            }\n            for (; x < end; ++x) {\n                int sum = dp[x] + left;\n                if (sum >= MOD) sum -= MOD;\n                dp[x] = left = sum;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    cout << dp[n - 1] << '\\n';\n    return 0;\n}\n","path":"src/solution.cpp"}],"hypothesis":"A reusable row bitmap enumerates obstacles in column order without sorting, allowing contiguous obstacle-free DP runs with no per-cell obstacle lookup.","notes":"Duplicates collapse naturally in the bitmap. Initialization covers n=1 and blocked endpoints. No commands or measurements were performed.","research":{"queries":[],"urls":[]},"sources_kept":[],"transformations":["Replace the quadratic blocked grid with per-row obstacle lists and one reusable packed bitmap.","Scan set bits to delimit contiguous free-cell runs without sorting obstacle lists.","Use one in-place DP row, carry the left value in a scalar, and replace modular division with conditional subtraction."]}